OL,3,GNEWSAPark memories take Jorja Smith
OL,4,Aback to childhood
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrit Award-winning singer Jorja Smith
OL,7,Fhas fondly recalled childhood visits to
OL,8,FWalsall Arboretum, describing it as a
OL,9,Fplace that reminds her of "being
OL,10,Fyounger".
OL,12,FThe Walsall-born musician spoke about
OL,13,Fthe park in a video shared on social
OL,14,Fmedia while reflecting on her hometown
OL,15,Froots.
OL,17,FSmith said the Arboretum was one of the
OL,18,Fplaces she enjoyed returning to
OL,19,Fwhenever she visited Walsall.
