OL,3,GNEWSAPark memories take Jorja Smith
OL,4,Aback to childhood
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I just think it's a really nice place
OL,7,Fto come, have a walk, see some trees.
OL,8,FIf the skies are blue, it looks really
OL,9,Fpretty," she said.
